<title>USA: Prestige Financial Corp Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Prestige Financial Corp Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>FLEMINGTON, N.J. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended  For the Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>		    9/30/96    9/30/95	   9/30/96    9/30/95</p>
<p> Net income    $540,755   $338,462	$1,390,389   $849,433</p>
<p>Earnings per</p>
<p>share (fully</p>
<p>  diluted)	    .20     .14(a)		 .52     .35(a)</p>
